1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:05,640
乔 拿着这根球杆 把那颗球打出去
Okay, Joey, you take this club, and you hit that ball.

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:06,500
有问题吗
Any questions?

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,136
为什么这上面写着"曼尼"
Why does this say "Manny"?

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,720
别在意 他只用过一次
Don't worry about it. They were only used once.

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,680
算是我与他的一次"挥杆落空"经历
It was a swing and a miss for both of us.

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:16,499
我得想个新方式和乔共度美好时光
I needed to find a way to spend more quality time with Joe.

7
00:00:16,499 --> 00:00:18,740
周六捉迷藏我实在玩不下去了
I couldn't take another Saturday of hide-and-seek.

8
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,320
玩到现在 我藏在"柜子"里的时间
At this point, I've spent more time

9
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,580
已经比米奇尔还久了
in the closet than Mitchell.

10
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,840
高尔夫是非常复杂的运动
Golf is a very complicated sport.

11
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:27,940
你打不到也别泄...
I don't want you to get frustrated if you don't --

12
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:28,940
天啊
Holy cow!

13
00:00:29,705 --> 00:00:31,374
你觉得你能再来一次吗
Do you think you can do that again?

14
00:00:31,374 --> 00:00:32,540
能 很简单
Yeah. It's easy.

15
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,755
行了 自大狂先生
Okay, Mr. Cocky.

16
00:00:33,755 --> 00:00:36,840
这世上有种情况叫新手的好...
You know, there is a thing called beginner's --

17
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,020
什么鬼
What the hell?

18
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,180
布雷迪
Hey, Brady.

19
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,900
杰 你好吗 这是你孙子吗
Hey, Jay, what's up? Oh, is this your grandson?

20
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,560
这话我听够了 这是我儿子
I can't do this again. This is my son.

21
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,860
看看他挥杆告诉我你怎么想
Just take a look at his swing and tell me what you think.

22
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:51,360
你妈妈肯定是名优秀运动员
Your mom must be some athlete.

23
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,500
提醒你一下 我这人特别不喜欢
Just so you know, I'm not a guy who's charmed

24
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,660
服务员跟我自来熟
when the help gets familiar.

25
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:13,400
大家今早都过得好吗
How's everybody this fine morning?

26
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,600
我的新年决意已经坚持了三天
Welp, I'm on my third day of my New Year's Resolution

27
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:17,120
我不说别人不在乎的话
to not say things nobody cares about.

28
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:18,080
失误了
Damn it.

29
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:20,780
业主协会的回复
Oh, yay, Homeowners Association.

30
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:23,560
我需要他们批准我在后院盖女人窝
I need their approval to put a She Shed in the backyard

31
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:25,210
就是过去放跷跷板那块地
where the teeter-totter used to be.

32
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,115
我没听懂
I don't understand.

33
00:01:26,115 --> 00:01:28,908
她说女人窝"做"在跷跷板上
She said, "She Shed down by the seesaw."

34
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,900
您的才华怎么会埋没至今
How are you not famous?

35
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,180
是啊 真有才 但女人窝是什么
Yes, bravo, but what's a She Shed?

36
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:33,860
就是个简单的小棚子
Well, it's just a simple little structure

37
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:35,700
让我可以自己静静
where I can go to be alone

38
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:39,300
做做瑜伽或冥想 不受旁人打扰
and do yoga or meditate and nobody can bother me.

39
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,180
这么说在浴缸里喝红酒抽雪茄
Oh, so a glass of wine and a cigarette in the tub

40
00:01:41,180 --> 00:01:42,018
已经不管用了
isn't cutting it anymore?

41
00:01:42,018 --> 00:01:45,018
我不抽烟 宝贝 那是烟草味的香烛
I don't smoke, honey. I have a tobacco-scented candle.

42
00:01:45,018 --> 00:01:46,580
哪有烟草味的...
They don't make tobacco-scented --

43
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:48,120
你说的这些就是没人在乎的话
This is more of that stuff no one cares about.

44
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:50,020
恭喜你 亲爱的
Congratulations, honey.

45
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:52,360
别假装替我高兴了
Don't pretend you're happy for me.

46
00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:55,420
卢克和我想用那块地盖击球场
Luke and I wanted to use that space to put in a batting cage.

47
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,880
克莱尔想要她的女人窝
Claire wanted her She Shed.

48
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,300
我们陷入了僵局
We were in a stalemate,

49
00:01:58,480 --> 00:02:00,880
于是我们像成年人一样解决矛盾
so we settled the dispute like adults.

50
00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:08,260
加油 老爸 想想击球场
Come on, Dad. Batting cage.

51
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,680
我真的很需要眨眼 伙计
I really need to blink, buddy.

52
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:11,200
你去世以后可以眨个够
You can blink when you're dead.

53
00:02:14,512 --> 00:02:16,100
太棒了
Ah, yes! Yes!

54
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:18,920
当年那些三维立体画海报没白看
All those Magic Eye posters paid off.

55
00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:22,040
我要给自己买块毛绒绒的小地毯
I'm gonna get myself one of those fuzzy little rugs.

56
00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:24,270
-他们没批准 -什么
- They turned me down. - ?What?

57
00:02:24,270 --> 00:02:26,271
他们到底为什么...
Why on Earth would they do th-

58
00:02:26,565 --> 00:02:29,142
我要想办法联系上
I-I'm gonna find out how to get in touch with somebody

59
00:02:29,142 --> 00:02:30,800
那个业主协会里的某个人
from down at that Homeowners Association

60
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,380
弄清楚到底怎么回事
and find out what the hell is going on.

61
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:33,520
克莱尔 我知道你很生气
Claire, I know you're upset,

62
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,820
但我不认为你该那么做
but I don't think you should do that.

63
00:02:35,020 --> 00:02:36,240
瞧瞧啊
Well, look at that.

64
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:38,080
他们今天下午正好要开会
They have a meeting this afternoon.

65
00:02:38,310 --> 00:02:39,620
我亲自去一趟
I'll just go down there in person.

66
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:42,800
亲爱的 我有好多客户是业主协会推荐的
Honey, I get a lot of my referrals from the HOA.

67
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,560
和他们疏远了得不偿失
We can't afford to alienate them.

68
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,919
是他们要疏远别人
They are the ones who are alienating people.

69
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:49,320
他们都住在那个死胡同里
They all live on that stupid cul-de-sac.

70
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:50,820
只为自己人行方便
They only do things for each other.

71
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:53,600
如果他们不是都丑得要命没准会搞大群交
Probably swing if they weren't so aggressively unattractive.

72
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,800
我觉得"女人窝"这个叫法很冒犯人
You know, I find the term "She Shed" offensive.

73
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:57,820
为什么不管女人的窝叫窝
Shouldn't ours just be called a shed

74
00:02:57,820 --> 00:02:59,140
而男人的叫"男人窝"
and theirs a "He Shed"?

75
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,740
你的新年决意是白决的吗
Why do you bother making resolutions?

76
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,900
真让人泄气
This is so frustrating.

77
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:04,200
如果这话能安慰到你
If it's any comfort...

78
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,600
你不是唯一因为他们不如意的人
...you're not the only one to be stung by these people.

79
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:09,600
他们离谱的停车规定让我放弃了
Their ridiculous parking regulation made me give up my dream

80
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,380
买车顶有大热狗的车的梦想
of owning the Oscar Mayer Wienermobile.

81
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,580
好吧 我放手
Fine. I will move on.

82
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,140
这意味着我们能搭击球场了吗
So does this mean we can get our batting cage?

83
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,120
卢克 让人家缓缓
Luke, too soon.

84
00:03:19,407 --> 00:03:20,468
没错 快走
Yes. Go.

85
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,560
我真为你骄傲 老妈
I'm really proud of you, Mom.

86
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:25,120
放手体现了你的成熟
Letting go shows real growth.

87
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:27,040
我要去业主协会的会议
I'm going to that Homeowners Association meeting,

88
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,200
我的女人窝肯定要盖
and I'm getting my She Shed.

89
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,500
但你刚刚告诉老爸...
But you just told Dad --

90
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:30,780
我默允他表演魔术
I let him do magic.

91
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,040
他默允我打破承诺
He lets me break promises.

92
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,520
我们都知道彼此是什么样的人
We both know what we married.

93
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,340
你们又去球场了
You were at the course again?

94
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,800
这周每天上午都去
That's every morning this week.

95
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,960
冠军就是这么练出来的
That's how you make a champion.

96
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:41,340
你该看看乔的本事
You should see Joe play.

97
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,920
就像看名主持梅夫·格里芬采访一样
It's like watching Merv Griffin interview.

98
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,920
独有一套技巧
There's a certain finesse to it.

99
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,240
-你在训练什么项目 -啥也没练
- What are you training for? - Nothing.

100
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,400
没错 那就去吃布丁
Yeah, then go have a pudding cup.

101
00:03:50,570 --> 00:03:54,440
这些高能蛋白质棒是精英运动员吃的
These high-performance protein bars are for elite athletes.

102
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,580
吃吧 乔 补充能量
Go ahead, Joey. Fuel up.

103
00:03:55,780 --> 00:03:57,380
你今天有座奖杯要赢
You have a trophy to bring back today.

104
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,818
你这话是什么意思
What are you talking about?

105
00:03:58,818 --> 00:04:00,560
俱乐部办了场儿童锦标赛
There's a kiddie tournament up at the club,

106
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,800
我帮乔报名了
and I signed Joe up for it.

107
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:04,040
杰 你把他逼得太紧了
Jay, you're pushing him too hard.

108
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,720
你胡说什么 孩子可喜欢了
What are you talking about? Kid loves it.

109
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:08,880
等他冰敷好肩膀亲口告诉你
He'll tell you himself after he ices his shoulder.

110
00:04:09,835 --> 00:04:12,060
就是这个感觉
Ooh, that's the stuff.

111
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:13,520
歌洛莉亚 如果训练得当
You know, Gloria, with the right training,

112
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,820
这孩子能一路走到顶峰
this kid could go all the way.

113
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,420
当他的高尔夫生涯经理就是我的第二春
Me managing his golf career can be my second act.

114
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:21,160
你都七十了 你的第四春都该过劲了
You're 70. Your second act was two acts ago.

115
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:23,440
别利用他再次感受青春 他压力太大
Stop living through him. It's too much pressure.

116
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,600
你为什么这么小题大做
Why are you making such a big deal about it?

117
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,477
不过是个儿童高尔夫锦标赛
It's a-It's a kiddie golf tournament.

118
00:04:26,477 --> 00:04:29,120
就像个我不抗拒参加的儿童玩耍聚会
It's like a-a playdate I don't hate being at.

119
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,340
这是个馊主意
It's a bad idea.

120
00:04:30,340 --> 00:04:33,179
如果乔想做竞争性不这么强的事呢
What if Joe wants to do something that is less competitive,

121
00:04:33,179 --> 00:04:36,320
例如阅读或纸模
like reading or papier-mache?

122
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,540
我们先别把曼尼那套剧本都拿出来
Let's not break out the Manny playbook just yet.

123
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:41,060
叫戏单更有范 我帮什么嘴
Playbill would've been more cutting. Why am I helping you?

124
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:42,760
我知道关于什么对乔最好
I know you think you have the monopoly

125
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,140
你认为你有垄断权
on deciding what's best for Joe,

126
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:46,300
但我也有父母的天性
but I have parenting instincts, too.

127
00:04:46,540 --> 00:04:49,180
过去米奇和克莱尔的事我都让迪迪说了算
I deferred to Dede every single time on Mitch and Claire,

128
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:51,439
这次我要按我的直觉办
and this time I'm going with my gut.

129
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:54,048
米奇和克莱尔现在不是很好吗
Mitch and Claire turned out to be wonderful people.

130
00:04:54,048 --> 00:04:55,654
是的是的 我不是说他们不好
Yeah, yeah, yeah. I'm not knocking them.

131
00:04:55,654 --> 00:04:57,059
我对所有孩子的爱都是平等的
I love all my children equally.

132
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,980
这是冠军喝的水
That's winner water.

133
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:06,617
怎么回事 小卡
What's going on, Cam?

134
00:05:06,617 --> 00:05:07,960
我才离开四十五分钟
I was gone for 45 minutes,

135
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,480
咱家客厅就变成了美容沙龙
and now our living room's a beauty salon?

136
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:11,140
难不成你有一队[赛车]专业技师吗
What, do you have a pit crew or something?

137
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,740
你居然挺有男人样地
Ooh, look at you using "pit crew"

138
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:13,840
用"专业技师"成功造句了
in a sentence like a boy.

139
00:05:13,900 --> 00:05:15,940
这都是为了莉莉的派对吗 你...
Is this all for Lily's party? You --

140
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:17,478
我以为我们的计划是吃披萨看电影
I thought we were just gonna do pizza and a movie.

141
00:05:17,478 --> 00:05:19,720
要来的可是一帮十二岁少女
Okay, there are 12-year-old girls coming over here.

142
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:22,340
你忘了海莉在那年纪多毒舌多爱评头论足吗
Do you remember how mean and judgmental Haley was at that age?

143
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:24,220
记得 逼得我在感恩节装病
Yeah, I faked being sick that Thanksgiving.

144
00:05:24,540 --> 00:05:26,480
我都不敢在她面前吃玉米
I was too scared to eat corn in front of her.

145
00:05:26,580 --> 00:05:27,480
你当然不敢
Of course you were.

146
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:30,000
那一整年她对我说的唯一一个词是"恶心"
The only word she said to me that entire year was "Ew."

147
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,640
总之 莉莉想给这些学姐留个好印象
Anyway, Lily wants to impress these older girls,

148
00:05:32,740 --> 00:05:36,420
于是我弄了全方位沙龙帮她们大改造
so I set up a full-service salon to do makeovers.

149
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:38,700
你拥有这个资格是因为...
And you're qualified to do that because...?

150
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,040
我叔叔就是干这行的
Okay, my uncle was in the business

151
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,860
他让骡子看起来更年轻好卖出去
of mules appear younger for sale,

152
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:43,900
所以我认为我对美发和化妆略知一二
so I think I know a thing or two about hair and make-up.

153
00:05:45,555 --> 00:05:48,031
我拿了些东西来帮莉莉的派对做准备
I brought y'all some stuff for Lily's party.

154
00:05:48,031 --> 00:05:48,700
我的天
Oh, my God.

155
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:50,580
我想你可能不愿意用自己的护肤品
Thought you might not want to get into your own stash.

156
00:05:50,700 --> 00:05:52,579
我知道你的贵妇面霜有多贵
I know how pricy your lady creams are.

157
00:05:52,579 --> 00:05:55,496
她发脾气是因为我继承了老妈的皮肤
Okay, she's lashing out because I inherited Mama's skin.

158
00:05:55,548 --> 00:05:58,320
-而我继承了老爸的弹脑门绝招 -别
- And I got Daddy's strong flickin' finger. - Don't do it! Don't!

159
00:05:58,320 --> 00:05:59,960
小卡 你说过你不会搞得太大的
Cam, you said that you were gonna keep this small.

160
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:02,180
你瞧 我觉得你故意不告诉我
See, now I feel like you didn't tell me about this

161
00:06:02,180 --> 00:06:04,151
好在我拒绝前把这些都弄好
so that you could set it all up before I could say no.

162
00:06:04,151 --> 00:06:05,500
你这话可说错了
Okay, that is just not true.

163
00:06:05,500 --> 00:06:07,900
不是每个人都像你想得心机那么深
Not everyone is as calculating as you think.

164
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:10,460
但 我知道你为什么这样
But, hey, I know where this is coming from,

165
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:11,580
这不是你的错
and it's not your fault.

166
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:13,120
真的假的 又来这套
Seriously? This again?

167
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,560
这似乎是私人话题
This sounds private.

168
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:16,635
如果你想让我回避 想都别想
If you want me to leave, forget it.

169
00:06:16,635 --> 00:06:19,080
好吧 我们每次起了争执
Okay, a-any time we have an argument,

170
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,780
小卡都说是我童年阴影的错
Cam blames it on how I was brought up.

171
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:22,080
我的心理咨询师说
My therapist says

172
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,940
这是他转移责任的方式
that it's his way of deflecting responsibility.

173
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,660
你去做心理咨询
You go to therapy?

174
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:28,460
像伍迪·艾伦的电影里演得那样吗
You mean like one of those Woody Allen movies?

175
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,100
很多人都做心理咨询
Plenty of people go to therapy.

176
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,080
我们农场人就不去
Not farm folk.

177
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:33,580
我们有问题自己解决 尤其我们问题也不多
We solve our own problems, not that we had many.

178
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:35,600
没错 因为你们的童年像故事书里一样
That's right, because you had a storybook childhood.

179
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,700
我可没说过"故事书" 不过有一次
I never said "storybook," although one time

180
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:40,300
我回家时的确看到一家熊在吃我们的粥
I did come home to a family of bears eating our porridge.

181
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:42,200
别说得好像我们是乡巴佬一样
Don't make us sound like hicks.

182
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,760
是微波炉意面
It was Tuna Helper.

183
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,700
但我们也有过烦恼
But we did have our share of problems.

184
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,660
烦恼 什么烦恼
Problems? What problems?

185
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:50,100
老妈和老爸啊
Mama and Daddy?

186
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:52,420
他们的婚姻又不完美
It's not like they had the perfect marriage.

187
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:53,640
谢谢你 谢谢你
Thank you. Thank you.

188
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,260
我就知道有阴影 人人都有阴影
I knew there was stuff. Everybody has stuff.

189
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,720
不 没有阴影
No, there is no stuff.

190
00:06:56,780 --> 00:06:58,940
她在编故事想气皱我容光焕发的皮肤
She's just making this up to get under my radiant skin.

191
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,418
如果你不知道我在说什么
If you don't know what I'm talking about,

192
00:07:00,418 --> 00:07:03,080
我可不想在你主持大型派对前告诉你
I'm not gonna tell you right before you host a big ol' party.

193
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:06,060
不 我们有时间 快说给我们听听
Oh, no, no. We've got time. Come on, come on. Let's hear it.

194
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:09,500
你不记得有次老爸离开我们一整年
You don't remember that time Daddy didn't live with us for a year

195
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:11,410
因为他和那个餐厅服务员同居了吗
'cause he was shacked up with that diner waitress

196
00:07:11,410 --> 00:07:13,260
-珍妮·苏·巴特勒 -拜托
- Jannie Sue Butler? - Oh please.

197
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:15,600
老爸唯一离开我们那次是去参战了
The only time Daddy ever left was to go to war.

198
00:07:15,820 --> 00:07:18,798
1977年哪来的战争 小卡
It was 1977. What war, Cam?

199
00:07:18,798 --> 00:07:19,672
越...
The V-

200
00:07:20,586 --> 00:07:22,560
他离开我们是因为他到了四十岁
He left us 'cause he turned 40,

201
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,840
脸上长了第一块老年斑
he got his first liver spot,

202
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,920
他又觉得那骚货像《无敌女金刚》
and that bimbo reminded him of the Bionic Woman --

203
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:29,700
主要是因为她有条假胳膊
mostly on account of her fake arm.

204
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:33,180
你是真的不知情吗
Oh, did you really not know this?

205
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:33,960
什么
What?

206
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:37,300
我没意识到会是这么严重的问题
I did not realize how big that was gonna be.

207
00:07:38,552 --> 00:07:40,463
小卡 你还好吧
Cam, hey. Y-You're okay, right?

208
00:07:41,351 --> 00:07:44,084
小卡 我自己应付不来这些十二岁少女
Cam, I-I-I can't face these 12-year-olds by myself.

209
00:07:44,084 --> 00:07:47,055
十二岁 我得去换件衣服
12-year-olds? I got to change my shirt.

210
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:50,440
她们已经生气了
They're already angry.

211
00:07:51,946 --> 00:07:52,836
好吧
Um, okay. Uh...

212
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,635
你们在做什么
What are you guys doing?

213
00:07:55,635 --> 00:07:57,640
-搭击球场 -小心
- Putting up our batting cage. - Oh, careful.

214
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:58,980
这些网特别容易缠住脚
It's really easy to get caught in the net.

215
00:07:59,453 --> 00:08:01,200
你们或许想先缓缓
Okay, well, you may want to take a beat.

216
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:03,020
老妈去业主协会争取女人窝了
Mom went down to the HOA meeting to fight for her shed.

217
00:08:03,724 --> 00:08:06,400
我只希望她能冷静地接受他们的决定
?I only hope she keeps her cool and accepts their decision.

218
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:08,740
是啊 鉴于她以往总能放手的优秀历史
Yeah, based on her long history of letting things go.

219
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:11,160
爸 我们有麻烦了
Dad, we have a problem.

220
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:13,700
或许没事 伙计 业主协会从不反悔
Maybe not, buddy. The HOA never reverses itself.

221
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,380
要不然我们这场对话
If they did, we'd be having this conversation

222
00:08:15,380 --> 00:08:16,820
就能在大热狗车的前座上说了
in the front seat of a giant hot dog.

223
00:08:16,940 --> 00:08:18,820
-我就是业主协会 -什么
- I am the HOA. - ?What?

224
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:20,760
我截住了老妈的申请
I intercepted Mom's application

225
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,480
假造了一封协会的回绝信
and forged a rejection letter from the board.

226
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,520
-为什么 -因为你叫我那么做的
- Why?! ?- Because you told me to.

227
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,811
我什么时候叫你那么做的
When did I tell you to do that?!

228
00:08:25,811 --> 00:08:31,700
太棒了
Ah, yes! Yes!

229
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:34,500
当年那些三维立体画海报没白看
All those Magic Eye posters paid off!

230
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:36,900
真闹心
This sucks.

231
00:08:37,300 --> 00:08:37,700
谁知道
Who knows?

232
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:40,020
或许业主协会会拒绝她的申请
Maybe the HOA board will reject her application.

233
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:41,780
船到桥头自然直
Things have a way of working themselves out.

234
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:44,440
你说的是我想的吗
Are you saying what I think you're saying?

235
00:08:45,260 --> 00:08:46,040
应该是
I think so.

236
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:49,480
-你给了我暗示 -什么暗示
- You gave me the signal. - What signal?!

237
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:52,360
就你想让我秘密解决某事的时候那个眨眼
That wink when you want me to secretly take care of something.

238
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:56,100
我当然得眨眼 我刚结束瞪眼比赛
Of course I was winking. I was just in a staring contest.

239
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:58,780
什么 你是说你以前也这么做过吗
Wait. Did you say you've done this before?

240
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,340
你觉得艾丽克斯的大提琴会自燃嘛
Do you think Alex's cello set itself on fire?

241
00:09:01,660 --> 00:09:03,030
天啊
Oh, my God.

242
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:05,386
我得赶到那个大会 趁你妈还没...
I got to get down to that meeting before your mother --

243
00:09:07,312 --> 00:09:08,777
快帮我解开
Untangle me quickly!

244
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:10,220
等下 你在眨眼吗
Wait. Was that a wink?

245
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,875
你不想我帮你解开吗
Do you not want me to untangle you?

246
00:09:11,875 --> 00:09:13,580
还是你想我解慢点
D-Do you want me to untangle you slowly?

247
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:14,220
没有暗示
There's no signal!

248
00:09:17,762 --> 00:09:19,894
清爽的黄瓜水 不喝吗
Refreshing cucumber water? No?

249
00:09:20,541 --> 00:09:22,673
清爽的黄瓜水 不喝吗
Refreshing cucumber water? No?

250
00:09:22,726 --> 00:09:25,060
-你渴... -你做得很棒
- Are you thirs-- - Hey, you're doing great.

251
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:27,180
就是别紧张 别脸红
Just don't get nervous and turn all red.

252
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,680
我脸红啦 我现在脸红了吗
Do I do that? Am I doing that right now?

253
00:09:28,740 --> 00:09:29,700
其他人注意到了吗
Do people notice?

254
00:09:30,419 --> 00:09:31,938
你不是12岁了 没事
Okay, you're not 12. It's okay.

255
00:09:32,060 --> 00:09:33,638
变好了 变好了
It got better. It got better.

256
00:09:33,638 --> 00:09:35,580
小卡 你怎么样
Hey, Cam. H-How you feeling?

257
00:09:35,580 --> 00:09:36,650
如果你需要时间
If you need some time to

258
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:38,580
来消化有关父亲的事 你...
process that stuff about your dad, y-you sh--

259
00:09:38,580 --> 00:09:39,720
不 我没事
Oh, no. I'm fine.

260
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,680
不像梅勒妮头发上的氯
Unlike the chlorine in Melanie's hair

261
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,040
那事不会有什么永久性伤害的
that won't do any permanent damage.

262
00:09:43,820 --> 00:09:44,700
我在干活呢 亲爱的
I'm working here, sweetie.

263
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:48,680
姑娘们 我是莉莉的酷姑姑
Hi, girls. I'm Lily's cool Aunt Pam.

264
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,540
我给大家带了打火机哦
I brought lighters for everyone.

265
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,120
对我好点
Please be nice.

266
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:55,480
好了 完成啦 你觉得怎么样
All right. We are done. What do you think?

267
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:57,460
我是要当红歌手赛琳娜·戈麦斯的发型
I wanted to look like Selena Gomez.

268
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,960
我还想我爸遵守结婚誓言呢
Oh, well, I wanted a daddy that would respect his wedding vows,

269
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,120
但我们不能总是得到我们想要的
but we can't all get what we want.

270
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,840
现实点吧 去吧
Dream smaller. There you go.

271
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:06,080
好了 就是这些话
Okay, okay. See, it's stuff like that

272
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,500
让我觉得你其实在难过
that makes me think that you're not okay.

273
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:09,600
米奇尔 是玩笑 理发店专属吐槽
Mitchell, it's just a joke. It's barbershop sass.

274
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,880
他们喜欢我这么说
They love it when I go there.

275
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:13,980
好啦 维奥莱 挪动你的高档屁股来
All right, Violet, get your fancy can in the chair.

276
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:14,560
到你了
You're up.

277
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:19,160
你想做成什么样的
Hi. So, what are we doing today?

278
00:10:19,420 --> 00:10:20,600
我想要盘发
I was thinking of an updo.

279
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:22,360
你还是来个高马尾吧
I like a high pony for you.

280
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,460
开始啦
There we go.

281
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:28,380
小维啊 我在父母之夜上见了你妈
Oh, so, Vi, I've seen your mom at Parent Night.

282
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,800
你知道吗 我从没见过你爸
You know what? I've never seen your dad.

283
00:10:31,260 --> 00:10:32,360
他经常加班
He works late a lot.

284
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:34,120
宝贝 希望这是真的
Well, I hope that's true, sweetie.

285
00:10:34,660 --> 00:10:35,498
为什么不是真的
Why wouldn't it be?

286
00:10:35,498 --> 00:10:37,540
不知道 有时父亲会撒谎
I don't know. Sometimes father's lie.

287
00:10:37,540 --> 00:10:38,662
现在发现会比
It's better for you to find out now

288
00:10:38,662 --> 00:10:39,760
你已经40岁时才发现要好
than when you're a 40-year-old man.

289
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,740
40 说到父亲撒谎
40? Okay, speaking of fathers lying.

290
00:10:41,780 --> 00:10:42,980
我能和你聊下吗
Can I talk to you for a second?

291
00:10:43,460 --> 00:10:44,720
小卡 走 走
Cam, move away, move away.

292
00:10:46,980 --> 00:10:50,158
-小卡 你很明显在不开心嘛 -好吧
- Cam -- Cam, clearly you're not okay. - Okay, you know what?

293
00:10:50,158 --> 00:10:52,320
我以为我能压下去 关进房间并锁好
I thought -- I thought I could tamp it down, put it in a room,

294
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,260
就像爷爷的狂犬病时我们做的那样
seal it shut just like we did grandpa when he got rabid.

295
00:10:54,260 --> 00:10:56,491
听着 我和我的咨询师打过招呼了
Okay, listen, I-I may have checked with my therapist

296
00:10:56,491 --> 00:10:58,560
如果你想和人谈谈...
on the off chance that you would want to talk to someone.

297
00:10:58,560 --> 00:10:59,560
不
No, sir.

298
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,919
一旦我开了那扇门 很难预料到会发现什么
If I open that door, there's no telling what we'll find.

299
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:04,400
你知道我听到那首歌《调情圣手》时
You know what? I -- You know I cry inexplicably

300
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,760
就会莫名其妙哭起来吗
when I hear "Smooth Operator."

301
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,500
我不想知道那是为什么
I don't want to know what that's about.

302
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:09,202
就试一下
Hey, hey, just -- just give it a shot.

303
00:11:09,202 --> 00:11:11,190
她很棒的 如果
Yeah, she's the best, and if --

304
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:13,699
如果你感到不舒服 我们就走 好吗
if it makes you uncomfortable, we can leave, all right?

305
00:11:13,699 --> 00:11:15,340
她今天下午有时间
She -- She has an opening this afternoon.

306
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:16,340
如果聚会还没结束呢
What if the party's still going on?

307
00:11:16,380 --> 00:11:17,880
你姐在这 不会有事的
Your sister's here. They'll be fine.

308
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:19,680
真心话
Okay, truth.

309
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:21,420
你第一次亲吻男生是多大
How old were you when you first kissed a boy?

310
00:11:22,048 --> 00:11:23,421
男的 人吗
Hmm...A boy person?

311
00:11:25,380 --> 00:11:26,640
我喜欢你回家
I love that you're here,

312
00:11:26,660 --> 00:11:29,200
但你们学校不是有洗衣房吗
but don't you guys have a laundry room at the school?

313
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,561
那里很潮湿
It's really humid down there,

314
00:11:30,561 --> 00:11:32,444
我的头发可无法承受
and my hair is challenging enough as it is.

315
00:11:32,620 --> 00:11:34,200
我还以为你会去看乔的比赛
I thought you'd be going to Joe's tournament.

316
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,900
不 他不需要我
No, he doesn't need me over there.

317
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:37,418
我只会增加压力
I would be adding more pressure.

318
00:11:37,418 --> 00:11:38,964
你在我的丝带舞比赛上
Well, you always kept a low profile

319
00:11:38,964 --> 00:11:40,660
就总是很低调啊
at my ribbon-dancing competitions.

320
00:11:40,660 --> 00:11:41,860
我在看台上都找不到你
I couldn't even find you in the stands.

321
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:46,020
对 有丝带还有嗖嗖嗖的声音
Ah, yeah, with the ribbon and the swooshing.

322
00:11:47,340 --> 00:11:50,469
但乔让我担心 因为压力会摧毁孩子
But Joe worries me because stress can destroy a child.

323
00:11:50,469 --> 00:11:54,440
我从我们地区青少年仰泳比赛中得到的教训
Take it from Cartagena's junior regional backstroke champion.

324
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,380
你还会游泳吗
You used to swim?

325
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:59,140
就像到公海躲条子的快艇一样快
Like a cigarette boat fleeing to international waters.

326
00:11:59,353 --> 00:12:03,000
但压力唤醒我心中的黑暗
But all that stress brought the darkness in me.

327
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,840
我开始抓狂 然后发生了意外
I started pulling out my hair, and...there was an incident.

328
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:07,980
什么意外
What kind of incident?

329
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,660
我羞于承认
I'm ashamed to admit it,

330
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,820
但我输了一场重要的比赛后
but when I lost one of the big races,

331
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:14,360
我貌似用了泳池捞叶网
I might have hit one of the other swimmers

332
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,818
砸了其他选手的腿
in the leg with a skimmer pole.

333
00:12:15,818 --> 00:12:17,549
你对别的姑娘使出了"坦雅·哈丁"吗
You Tonya Harding-ed another girl?

334
00:12:17,549 --> 00:12:20,805
不 在哥伦比亚 这招名叫"歌洛莉亚·拉米雷兹"
No, in Colombia, they call it the Gloria Ramirez-ing.

335
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:25,480
妈 你崩溃了不代表乔也会
Mom, just because you freaked out doesn't mean Joe will.

336
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:26,940
说到底
At the end of the day,

337
00:12:26,940 --> 00:12:28,820
他以后只会记得你没去看比赛
he's only going to remember that you weren't there.

338
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:29,880
我不知道
I don't know.

339
00:12:30,020 --> 00:12:31,380
我觉得会对他意义很重大
I think it would mean a lot to him.

340
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:32,760
就像你当年为我和搭档加油
I know it meant a lot to me

341
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:35,119
对我来说也意义非凡一样
when you cheered on me and my ribbon-dancing partner, Josh.

342
00:12:35,119 --> 00:12:37,361
因为你们太棒了嘛
Uh, yeah, 'cause you guys were so great.

343
00:12:37,361 --> 00:12:38,635
我是独舞
I danced alone.

344
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:43,640
下一议程
Next order of business,

345
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:47,400
丽萨想在她院子里挖个护城沟
uh, Lisa would like to put in a little moat in her yard.

346
00:12:48,273 --> 00:12:49,240
配一个开合式吊桥
Aww, and with a drawbridge

347
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,840
从人行道直达前门
from the sidewalk to the front door.

348
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,900
我从小就有个公主梦
I've always dreamed of being a princess.

349
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,176
大家同意吗
All in favor?

350
00:12:54,176 --> 00:12:56,280
-爱[同意] -"哎"哟妈呀
- Aye! - Eyesore.

351
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:57,239
克莱尔 你说什么了吗
Claire, did you say something?

352
00:12:57,239 --> 00:13:00,874
抱歉 你们就这么通过了丽莎公主的申请
I'm sorry. You're just gonna rubber-stamp Princess Lisa here,

353
00:13:00,874 --> 00:13:03,400
但我却不能在自家后院盖女人窝吗
and I can't have a She Shed in my backyard?

354
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:04,693
你能等轮到你时在说吗
Could you please wait your turn?

355
00:13:04,693 --> 00:13:07,220
我们还没到新议题呢
W-We haven't moved on to new business yet.

356
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:09,580
行 申请讨论新议题
Fine. Motion to discuss new business?

357
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:12,520
附议 准许克莱尔·邓菲发言 感谢你
Seconded. Recognizing Claire Dunphy. Thank you.

358
00:13:12,620 --> 00:13:14,240
我拿到我的许可之前是不会走的
I'm not leaving here until I have my permit.

359
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:15,460
你在说什么呢
What are you talking about?

360
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:17,980
我投递了搭建一个简单建物的申请
I submitted a request to build a simple structure

361
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:20,320
从街上看不到 不影响景观
you can't even see from the street.

362
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:23,300
说到影响 为什么没有人
Speaking of which, why is nobody sounding the alarm

363
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:26,017
给盖里的前卫邮箱踩刹车
over Gary's avant-garde mailbox?

364
00:13:26,128 --> 00:13:27,949
-形状就是个鸡鸡啊 盖里 -宝贝
- It's a penis, Gary. - Honey.

365
00:13:27,949 --> 00:13:30,163
干嘛 什么 你来这里干嘛
What? What? Oh! What are you doing here?

366
00:13:30,163 --> 00:13:31,280
我还打算问你这个问题呢
I was gonna ask you the same thing.

367
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,360
抱歉打扰了 请继续你们的出色工作
I'm so sorry to interrupt. Keep up the great work.

368
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,140
同志们真是辛苦了
It couldn't have been easy

369
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:35,820
不让下水道鳄鱼新闻流出 造成恐慌
keeping that sewer gator under wraps.

370
00:13:36,580 --> 00:13:37,200
哪有什么鳄鱼
What alligator?

371
00:13:38,420 --> 00:13:39,200
这样是不对的
No, that.

372
00:13:39,220 --> 00:13:40,640
就是这样 这不公平啊
See that? That's not fair.

373
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:43,380
就因为我不是你们业主协会邪教的一份子
Just because I'm not part of your little cul-de-sac cult --

374
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,920
-你们这业主"邪"会 -这哏不错
- your little cult-de-sac -- - Oh, that was a good one.

375
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,319
我觉得大家懂你意思了 我们走吧
I think you made your point. Why don't we get going?

376
00:13:47,319 --> 00:13:50,135
克莱尔 我们没听过你的女人窝啊
Claire, this is the first we're hearing about your She Shed.

377
00:13:50,450 --> 00:13:53,520
那我这里有个东西给你们
Oh. Then I've got something for you right here.

378
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:54,480
她有枪
She's got a gun!

379
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:56,540
是一封信好吗 丽莎
It's a letter, Lisa --

380
00:13:56,840 --> 00:14:00,580
印有业主协会字样的拒绝信件
a rejection letter on HOA stationery.

381
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:01,400
信件吗
Stationery?

382
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:03,077
为了减少树木砍伐
In the interest of saving trees,

383
00:14:03,077 --> 00:14:05,580
我们所有的信件来往都是通过电邮
we do all our correspondence via e-mail.

384
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:06,900
走啦 克莱尔 我们不需要坐在这里
Come on, Claire, we don't need to sit here

385
00:14:06,900 --> 00:14:08,740
听这些社区栋梁说的话
and listen to these pillars of the community.

386
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,920
那这封信是谁寄给我的
Then who sent me this letter?

387
00:14:10,553 --> 00:14:12,566
还有谁知道我想搭个女人窝
Who knew I even wanted a She Shed?

388
00:14:12,566 --> 00:14:14,489
有谁会在意这个呢
Who even...cared?

389
00:14:20,660 --> 00:14:21,140
好啦
Okay.

390
00:14:22,560 --> 00:14:23,840
小家伙 就是个直射
It's a straight shot, pal.

391
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:26,340
你能行 你感觉如何
You got this. How are you feeling?

392
00:14:26,660 --> 00:14:27,720
我有点紧张
I'm nervous.

393
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:30,140
我儿子正在接受运动员的考验
My son was being tested as an athlete,

394
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:32,040
而我也在接受当父亲的考验
but I was being tested as a father.

395
00:14:32,420 --> 00:14:36,220
我那一刻说的话将会影响乔人格的发展
What I said then would help shape the man Joe would become.

396
00:14:36,900 --> 00:14:37,840
废物才会紧张
Nerves are for losers.

397
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,100
你现在的感觉是兴奋
What you're feeling is excitement

398
00:14:40,100 --> 00:14:41,820
因为这是你人生第一次
because for the first time in your life

399
00:14:41,820 --> 00:14:43,560
在做真正有意义的事情
you're doing something that actually matters.

400
00:14:44,140 --> 00:14:46,360
其他的那些孩子 都想你怯场
These other kids -- they want you to choke

401
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,520
因为你是山丘之王 君临天下
because you're king of the mountain,

402
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:49,080
而他们也想爬上山顶
and they're climbing to reach you.

403
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:51,360
所以你得准备好踩掉他们登顶的手指
You've got to be ready to step on their fingers.

404
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:52,680
感觉好狠心啊
That sounds mean.

405
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,380
他们也会对你做同样的事
They would do the same thing to you.

406
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:56,560
去吧 拿下属于我们的荣誉
Now, get out there and take what is ours.

407
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:57,760
然后享受过程啊
And have fun.

408
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:11,160
这挺新鲜
Huh. That's new.

409
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:15,900
她就在我后面 她知道假信的事了
She's right behind me. She knows about the letter.

410
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:17,560
我们该怎么办 我们得想个解释啊
What are we gonna do? We have to think of an excuse.

411
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:18,580
我们没时间了
We don't have time!

412
00:15:22,301 --> 00:15:23,452
她可能遇到红灯了
Huh. Guess she hit a light.

413
00:15:23,545 --> 00:15:26,074
好吧 那我们来想想
All right. Well, let's think this through.

414
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:29,120
不是吧 菲尔 你就转身逃跑吗
Really, Phil?! You just turned and ran?

415
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,240
亲爱的 我...
Sweetheart, I...

416
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:33,160
-我 -你别想跑
- I... - Don't you run again.

417
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:33,760
好
Okay.

418
00:15:34,340 --> 00:15:36,060
我只有一个问题 为什么
I have one question. Why?

419
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:38,080
一言难尽
It's complicated.

420
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,400
怎么一言难尽了
How is it complicated?

421
00:15:39,920 --> 00:15:42,040
你印假的信纸 伪造一封信
You printed fake stationery and forged a letter

422
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,860
就为了让自己有个傻逼击球场
so you could have a stupid batting cage.

423
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,520
-这不是他的错 -卢克
- It's not his fault. - Luke --

424
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:46,658
我来告诉她
I'm gonna tell her.

425
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:49,060
-他害怕了 -什么
- He got scared. - What?

426
00:15:49,140 --> 00:15:49,860
他害怕你以后
He thought you would like

427
00:15:49,860 --> 00:15:51,540
会想整天泡在你的女人窝里
being out there alone in your shed so much

428
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:53,200
你不会想再跟他待在一起
you'd stop wanting to spend time with him.

429
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,120
怎么会
Come on.

430
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:57,380
他担心说不定你哪天就开始睡在里面
He was worried maybe you'd start sleeping out there.

431
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:59,880
很快那里就成了你与闺蜜们喝酒
Pretty soon it's where you and your friends go to drink

432
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:01,339
然后抱怨自己老公的地方
and complain about your husbands.

433
00:16:01,339 --> 00:16:02,844
抱怨老公不需要个女人窝啊
Oh, I don't need a shed for that.

434
00:16:02,844 --> 00:16:04,720
我们都是用手机群聊
We-we do it on a group text.

435
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,320
亲爱的 我都不知道你有这感觉
Honey, I didn't know that's how you felt.

436
00:16:06,380 --> 00:16:07,720
你为什么不跟我说说呢
Why didn't you say something?

437
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,400
可能我不好意思露出内心的脆弱
I guess I'm not comfortable being vulnerable...

438
00:16:10,524 --> 00:16:12,601
给除了卢克之外的人
...except-except with Luke.

439
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:15,660
我想盖那个女人窝的原因
The whole reason I wanted to get that shed

440
00:16:15,660 --> 00:16:18,160
是给自己一个能静下心的地方
was to give myself a place to calm down

441
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:20,120
然后你也不用承受我像疯婆子
and spare you some of my insanity.

442
00:16:20,347 --> 00:16:24,400
我本来还觉得这会让我们感情更好呢
If anything, I-I thought it would help our relationship.

443
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:24,880
亲爱的
Sweetheart.

444
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,521
他接受你的道歉
He accepts your apology.

445
00:16:26,521 --> 00:16:27,675
剩下交给我就行了 兄弟
I got it from here, buddy. Mm.

446
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:33,000
我们得到了击球场 某种程度上吧
We got our batting cage... sort of.

447
00:16:34,671 --> 00:16:37,365
妈 你觉得很快能轮到我跟爸上场吗
Hey, Mom, think we can get in there any time soon?

448
00:16:37,396 --> 00:16:39,568
老娘今天这心情 别想了
Not after the day I've had!

449
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:42,320
走吧 兄弟 咱们明天再来碰运气
Come on, buddy. Let's try again tomorrow.

450
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:44,980
来啊
Come on.

451
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:46,560
爽
Yeah!

452
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,160
给
Here you go.

453
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:52,520
这什么鬼 我要推杆
What is this?! I need a putter!

454
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:54,820
放轻松嘛 落后一杆而已
Take it easy. You're only down by one stroke.

455
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:56,380
别提醒我
Don't remind me!

456
00:16:57,220 --> 00:16:59,440
没事的 各位 他没事
He's fine, everybody. He's fine.

457
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:00,860
祝你好远 乔
Good luck, Joe.

458
00:17:01,100 --> 00:17:03,640
歌洛莉亚 我猜你是来把乔拉回家的吧
Gloria? I-I guess you're here to pull Joey out of the tournament.

459
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:05,000
没没没 我是来给他加油的
No, no. I came to cheer him on.

460
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:06,420
不 我想过了你说的那些话
No, but I thought about what you were saying,

461
00:17:06,500 --> 00:17:07,400
虽然你当时说得有些不对
and even though you weren't right,

462
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,460
但我还是决定按你说的做
I'm gonna let you have this one.

463
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:09,820
你可以的 宝贝
You can do this, baby.

464
00:17:10,140 --> 00:17:11,940
别打扰我集中精神
I'm trying to concentrate!

465
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,660
这火气是怎么回事
What is that all about?

466
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,620
不知道啊 歌洛莉亚 你好像会让他紧张
I don't know, Gloria. You seem to make him tense.

467
00:17:19,835 --> 00:17:22,492
-还有就是这个问题 -我就知道
- Uh, and there's this other thing. - I knew it!

468
00:17:22,492 --> 00:17:24,050
你干扰了我的视线
You were in my eyeline!

469
00:17:24,050 --> 00:17:26,168
别 乔 快回来
No. Wait. Joe, come here!

470
00:17:26,168 --> 00:17:28,662
-我要踩了你的手指 -乔 快回来
- I'm going to step on your fingers! - Joe, come back here!

471
00:17:28,662 --> 00:17:30,780
-我才是山丘之王 -把球杆给我
- I'm the king of the mountain! - Give me the club!

472
00:17:30,780 --> 00:17:31,960
球杆给我
Give me the club.

473
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,200
快给我
Give me the club!

474
00:17:33,766 --> 00:17:35,420
干嘛啊
Why?!

475
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:36,460
又来了
Not again.

476
00:17:37,460 --> 00:17:38,660
曲棍球绝对是你的菜
You're gonna love hockey.

477
00:17:40,660 --> 00:17:41,358
你知道吗
You know what?

478
00:17:41,358 --> 00:17:44,122
如果我老家的人知道我来心理咨询师这里
If people back home knew I was in a therapist's office,

479
00:17:44,122 --> 00:17:47,000
绝对会在我们当地杂志上的
it would be all over the "Rumors and Ramblins" section

480
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,820
"八卦漫谈"环节 大书特书
of the Grasshopper Gazette.

481
00:17:49,199 --> 00:17:51,480
"自由左派西海岸毁了本地英雄"
"Liberal Left Coast Breaks Local Hero."

482
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,160
你在打什么字
What are you typing?

483
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:53,420
你刚才说的每一字每一句
Exactly what you just said,

484
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:55,000
别担心 是我的咨询要用 不是你的
but don't worry, it's for my therapy, not yours.

485
00:17:55,060 --> 00:17:56,940
是啊 这的确是你的咨询
You know what? This is your therapy,

486
00:17:56,940 --> 00:17:58,640
我也不想在这里
and I don't want to be here.

487
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:00,160
别这样 小卡 你也需要这个
Cam, come on. You need this.

488
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:02,360
你就试一次嘛 行不
Just give it a shot. Come on!

489
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:04,100
你好啊 米奇尔
Hello, Mitchell.

490
00:18:04,340 --> 00:18:05,220
你好 格林医生
Hi, Dr. Green.

491
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:07,700
谢谢您特别空出时间来见我们
Thank you so much for making the time to see us.

492
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,560
好吧 你那是什么声音
Okay, what's that voice?

493
00:18:09,780 --> 00:18:10,903
你是在试着压抑
Are you tamping down your

494
00:18:10,903 --> 00:18:12,460
-自己的神经病来让你的医生夸你吗 -没啊
- crazy to impress your therapist... - No. No.

495
00:18:12,460 --> 00:18:14,780
就像你在家政女佣来之前 先打扫一遍一样
...like you do when you clean up before the housekeeper comes?

496
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,060
感谢你的这些话
I appreciate what you're saying,

497
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:21,060
我听到了 我会好好想想
I hear you, and I'm gonna give it some thought.

498
00:18:21,140 --> 00:18:22,898
什么鬼 我们能搬来这里住吗
The hell? Can we move into this place?

499
00:18:22,898 --> 00:18:24,260
-你一定是卡梅隆吧 -是的
- You must be Cameron. - Yes.

500
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:26,640
很高兴跟你见面 我听过好多你的事
So nice to meet you. I've heard so much about you --

501
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:31,318
米奇尔 你对现在自己的举动有什么看法
Mitchell, how do you feel about how you're behaving right now?

502
00:18:31,318 --> 00:18:33,697
不是太满意 我能重来吗
I don't love it. Can I-Can I restart?

503
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:34,260
好的
Okay.

504
00:18:34,984 --> 00:18:36,516
好的 这个嘛
A-All right. Um, you know what?

505
00:18:36,516 --> 00:18:38,520
这个... 这... 我不想在这里
This -- This -- I don't want to be here.

506
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:39,980
这不适合我
This just isn't me.

507
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:41,799
墙上的画好奇怪
The art on the wall is weird.

508
00:18:41,799 --> 00:18:43,829
糖果感觉像是心理测试
The candy bowl feels like a test, uh...

509
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:46,980
这样吧 我要吃 就吃一个吧
You know what? I'm gonna have, uh, just one.

510
00:18:46,980 --> 00:18:49,880
不要 我要吃全部
Nope. I'm gonna have all of them.

511
00:18:50,740 --> 00:18:52,420
不对 我要走了
Nope. I'm just gonna leave.

512
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:55,220
小卡 跨出第一步最难 但值得你尝试
Cam, the first step is the hardest, but it's worth it.

513
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:57,860
家庭的问题需要时间来修复
It takes time to work through family issues.

514
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:59,960
她说的对 有些人花了一生时间
Yeah, she's right. Some people spend their whole lives

515
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:01,650
在试着解决这些问题呢
trying to resolve these things.

516
00:19:01,650 --> 00:19:04,028
那我... 那我跟她说什么啊
What would I -- What would I even say to her?

517
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:08,480
我爸跟一个小镇公交女跑了一年
That my dad left for a year with the town floozy

518
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,960
我还以为那年他是去打仗
and I thought he was off being a war hero

519
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:10,958
我就像个傻逼一样
and that I'm an idiot

520
00:19:10,958 --> 00:19:13,111
而且我永远不会原谅他
and-and that I'm never gonna forgive him?

521
00:19:13,208 --> 00:19:16,280
我才不管他最后又回归家庭了呢
I don't care that he came-came back to us.

522
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:18,780
他骗了我 他让我从小到大都以为
He lied to me, and he let me grow up thinking my mama

523
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:21,360
我妈妈是他在世上最珍重的人
was the most important thing to him in the world.

524
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,160
他就是个骗子
He's a phony.

525
00:19:23,238 --> 00:19:25,640
但或许... 他尽力了
You know, maybe, you know, he did do the best

526
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:28,195
用他会的那种方式
he-he knew how, you know?

527
00:19:28,195 --> 00:19:32,908
他总是让我觉得安全与开心
He always did make me feel safe and-and happy.

528
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:37,040
或许他只是想保护我
Maybe he was just trying to protect me,

529
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:39,440
因为他的确是全心全意爱着我
because he did love me with all of his heart,

530
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:42,601
而且我感觉自己了解了他
and, actually, I feel like I know him,

531
00:19:42,601 --> 00:19:46,232
比以前更了解 更爱他
like, even better now and love him even more.

532
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:51,280
是我的经历造就了我
I am the person I am because of all my experiences.

533
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:54,000
而我爱我自己
And I like me.

534
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:58,360
为此 我得谢谢我爸爸
And I have a daddy to thank for that.

535
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:02,760
感觉舒畅了好多
Hey! That felt great.

536
00:20:03,100 --> 00:20:04,789
天啊 感觉被治愈了
Oh, my gosh. I feel healed.

537
00:20:04,789 --> 00:20:07,220
很好的开始 但心理咨询...
Yeah, well, it's a good start, but therapy really is a --

538
00:20:07,220 --> 00:20:09,500
不不不不不 太厉害了
No, no, no, no, no, no. That was extraordinary.

539
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:12,100
我从来没有见过像这样的
I have never seen anything like that.

540
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:13,860
他不需要我
He doesn't need me.

541
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:15,100
给
Here.

542
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:18,440
吃颗糖 祝你幸福
Have a hard candy and a good life.

543
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:21,500
等等 他完事了吗 不行
Wait, wait, wait, wait. He's done? No, no.

544
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:24,400
我 我来这里看十年了
Okay, I have-I have been coming here for 10 years,

545
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:26,520
而我还不得其门而入
and I am just barely scratching the surface.

546
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:28,138
而你夸他太厉害了
You call him extraordinary.

547
00:20:28,138 --> 00:20:31,280
而我呢 我每周都来这里掏心掏肺
Meanwhile, I've been pouring out my soul to you every week,

548
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:33,300
而我得到的反应只有... 什么都没有
and I get -- boop -- nothing.

549
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:37,420
米奇尔 我有空出一小时时间
Mitchell, I did clear out the full hour.

550
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:39,315
如果你想要...
If you'd like to --

551
00:20:39,315 --> 00:20:41,060
那就最好不过了 医生 太感谢你了
That would be great, Doctor. Thank you so much.

552
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:41,580
我很乐意
I would love that.

553
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:43,780
小卡 我们回家见 行 行
Cam, I will see you at home. Okay, okay.

554
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:47,200
-你选了正确的那个 -我在等着呢
- You chose the right one. - I'm waiting!

555
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:52,120
你可真会躲啊 小家伙
You sure know how to hide, buddy.

556
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:54,360
我到处在找你呢
I'm looking everywhere.

557
00:20:57,186 --> 00:20:59,361
不对 不在台球桌底下
Nope, not under the pooltable.

558
00:21:00,063 --> 00:21:02,126
你到底能躲在哪里呢
Where or where could you be?

559
00:21:02,126 --> 00:21:04,545
曼尼 我很忙
Manny, I'm very busy.

560
00:21:04,545 --> 00:21:05,704
不能之后再说吗
Can't this wait?

561
00:21:05,704 --> 00:21:07,900
我等了10年了 别想躲 坐下
I've waited 10 years. This is happening. Sit.

562
00:21:07,900 --> 00:21:09,360
我在看东西呢
Hey, I'm watching something.

563
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,276
是的 请看
Yes, you are!

564
00:21:10,276 --> 00:21:13,477
带来演出"丝带狂想曲"
Presenting "Rhapsody in Ribbon."

565
00:21:17,069 --> 00:21:18,963
找到你了 换我去躲
You are it. I'm hiding.

566
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:20,720
一
One.

567
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:21,280
二
Two.

568
00:21:22,780 --> 00:21:23,340
三
Three.

569
00:21:23,340 --> 00:21:23,900
四
Four.

570
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:25,260
五
Five.

571
00:21:25,980 --> 00:21:26,540
六
Six.
